	<section_number>22.1-272</section_number>
	<catch_line>Contagious and infectious diseases</catch_line>
	<text>
		Persons suffering with contagious or infectious disease shall be excluded from the public schools while in that condition.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 22-249; 1968, c. 445; 1970, c. 526; 1973, c. 491; 1974, c. 160; 1977, c. 220; 1979, c. 262; 1980, c. 559.</history>
